// asserts 1:1 parity against the snapshot generated by
// `go run ./scripts/dump-error-codes.go` (error-codes.generated.json).
// New backend codes cannot ship without a Portuguese string here.
//
// Single FE-synthetic code: `authn.expired` is dispatched by api/client.ts
// when the session lapses; it is intentionally allow-listed in the coverage
// test rather than emitted by the backend.
//
// Grouped by module/concern for review. Keep alphabetical within a group.

